{"3470800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Save Mom", "steam_appid": 3470800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you protect Mom?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you’ve got left is Mom, and your old motorhome. Survive as you drive through a post-apocalyptic United States. Explore cities ravaged by mutants and pollution. Scavenge for resources, upgrade your ride, and turn it into a vehicle of utter destruction. Play solo or team up with 1-3 friends. Unleash hell on the forces trying to hurt Mom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Defend Mom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/e774faf95673c106c7d80c8448ddf81c.poster.avif?t=1788196760\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/e774faf95673c106c7d80c8448ddf81c.webm?t=1788196760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/e774faf95673c106c7d80c8448ddf81c.mp4?t=1788196760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mom is kind-hearted and gentle. She always sees the good in others, even in those destroying the world. Protect Mom as she tries to pet mutants, have tea with Illuminati spellcasters, or offer cookies to billionaire skin-dancing cultists</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op action!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/f6c81a8fe565393281b310605b507c52.poster.avif?t=1788196760\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/f6c81a8fe565393281b310605b507c52.webm?t=1788196760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/f6c81a8fe565393281b310605b507c52.mp4?t=1788196760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to three friends! Can you work together to make sure Mom reaches her destination safely?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/0e4fe5e8b0cff19035f7b18c2dfcd99b.poster.avif?t=1788196760\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/0e4fe5e8b0cff19035f7b18c2dfcd99b.webm?t=1788196760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/0e4fe5e8b0cff19035f7b18c2dfcd99b.mp4?t=1788196760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a family member to play as. Each one has a particular set of skills, from close-range brawling to long-range blasting. Upgrade as you advance and customize their abilities to match your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/7fb99c69e7ef6225a56f322275e04a53.poster.avif?t=1788196760\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/7fb99c69e7ef6225a56f322275e04a53.webm?t=1788196760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/7fb99c69e7ef6225a56f322275e04a53.mp4?t=1788196760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find gas stations, scrap yards, pharmacies, and many other points of interest. Gather everything you need to ensure a safe journey to her destination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build defenses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/40e9e8e1d7dc610b686855454bb6242c.poster.avif?t=1788196760\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/40e9e8e1d7dc610b686855454bb6242c.webm?t=1788196760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/40e9e8e1d7dc610b686855454bb6242c.mp4?t=1788196760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the resources you’ve gathered to build strong <strong>defenses</strong>. Mom's survival depends on it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade the RV</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/4b7484cc51cab1a53c9af6b733b7708a.poster.avif?t=1788196760\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/4b7484cc51cab1a53c9af6b733b7708a.webm?t=1788196760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/4b7484cc51cab1a53c9af6b733b7708a.mp4?t=1788196760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and install a large variety of upgrades for the RV mom is travelling in. Armor, turrets, spikey roller and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road ahead is full of terrors. Team up with friends or take on the danger alone. Mom won’t make it without you. <strong>Save Mom!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you protect Mom?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you’ve got left is Mom, and your old motorhome. Survive as you drive through a post-apocalyptic United States. Explore cities ravaged by mutants and pollution. Scavenge for resources, upgrade your ride, and turn it into a vehicle of utter destruction. Play solo or team up with 1-3 friends. Unleash hell on the forces trying to hurt Mom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Defend Mom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/e774faf95673c106c7d80c8448ddf81c.poster.avif?t=1788196760\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/e774faf95673c106c7d80c8448ddf81c.webm?t=1788196760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470800/extras/e774faf95673c106c7d80c8448ddf81c.mp4?t=1788196760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mom is kind-hearted and gentle. She always sees the good in others, even in those destroying the world. Protect Mom as she tries to pet mutants, have tea with Illuminati spellcasters, or offer cookies to billionaire skin-dancing cultists</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op action!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akam